Rule 2 (boolean, integer, string, and dtype inputs are not allowed)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 0 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 1 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 2 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 3 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 4 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 5 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 11 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 12
